### 应急无线电演练通联日志互证服务 —— 请求示例
### 可直接用 IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 执行。
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@drill = DRILL-2026

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 创建演练（允许时差 10 秒，非负；非法负值返回 422）
POST {{host}}/drills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drill_id": "{{drill}}",
  "allowed_time_diff_seconds": 10
}

### 查询演练状态
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}

### 单条写入/更正日志（路径上的记录号优先；时间必须带时区）
PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs/R1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_no": "R1",
  "station": "BH1AAA",
  "counterpart": "BH2BBB",
  "time": "2026-10-04T08:00:00+08:00",
  "band": "40m",
  "mode": "SSB"
}

PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs/R2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_no": "R2",
  "station": "BH2BBB",
  "counterpart": "BH1AAA",
  "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:05+00:00",
  "band": "40m",
  "mode": "SSB"
}

### 批量写入（整体事务；任一条非法或批次内记录号重复则整批拒绝）
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logs": [
    {
      "record_no": "R3",
      "station": "BH3CCC",
      "counterpart": "BH4DDD",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    },
    {
      "record_no": "R4",
      "station": "BH4DDD",
      "counterpart": "BH3CCC",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:08+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    }
  ]
}

### 查看全部日志
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs

### 查询互证结果（配对 + 未配对 + 版本 + 总时差）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/result

### 锁定一对互证候选（记录号顺序任意，服务端内部升序）
### 仅接受：现存、相互指认、波段/模式相同、时差不超允许值，
### 且两条记录均未被其他锁定占用。锁定强制入选结果（即使拉低全场配对数）。
PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_a": "R1",
  "record_b": "R2"
}

### 重复锁定同一对（含颠倒顺序）视为重传：200，版本不推进
PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_a": "R2",
  "record_b": "R1"
}

### 查询锁定清单及最新互证结果
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks

### 解除已有锁定（不存在则 404 lock_not_found；顺序同样任意）
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks/unlock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_a": "R1",
  "record_b": "R2"
}

### 版本快照（复核员回看/比较，均为只读，不改变当前状态）

### 列出全部已留存版本（创建演练即有 0 版；重传/失败回滚/封存不留快照）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots

### 取回版本 0 快照（创建演练时的空场）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/0

### 取回版本 1 快照（该版配对、未配对、总时差与锁定清单；封存状态从现态读取）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/1

### 比较两个已留存版本（相同版本差异为空；任一版本未留存 -> 404）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/compare?from_version=0&to_version=1

### 反向比较也允许（增删方向互换）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/compare?from_version=1&to_version=0

### 封存演练（封存后写入与锁定操作均返回 409，查询仍可用；封存不产生新快照）
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/seal
